& [Profiles]
  + proposal cantor-evox2-remote-preflight-activation-proposal/0.1
  + proposal verification cantor-evox2-remote-preflight-activation-proposal-verification/0.1
  + operator decision cantor-evox2-remote-preflight-operator-decision/0.1
